</ul>
<h2 id="loose-list-blank-lines-between-items">Loose list (blank lines between items)<a class="markdown-heading-anchor" href="#loose-list-blank-lines-between-items" aria-label="Link to this section"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span></a></h2>
<ul>
<li>
