</li>
<li>
<p>Second item.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Third item.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="list-item-containing-multiple-paragraphs">List item containing multiple paragraphs<a class="markdown-heading-anchor" href="#list-item-containing-multiple-paragraphs" aria-label="Link to this section"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span></a></h2>
<ol>
<li>
<p>First paragraph of the item.</p>
<p>Second paragraph of the same item, which must stay inside the item rather than escaping into the document.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Next item.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h2 id="ordered-list-starting-at-a-number-other-than-1">Ordered list starting at a number other than 1<a class="markdown-heading-anchor" href="#ordered-list-starting-at-a-number-other-than-1" aria-label="Link to this section"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span></a></h2>
<ol start="5">
<li>Fifth</li>
<li>Sixth</li>
<li>Seventh</li>
</ol>
<p>The rendered list must preserve the starting number rather than silently renumbering from 1.</p>
<h2 id="list-item-containing-a-fenced-code-block">List item containing a fenced code block<a class="markdown-heading-anchor" href="#list-item-containing-a-fenced-code-block" aria-label="Link to this section"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span></a></h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Item with code:</p>
<div class="markdown-code"><div class="markdown-code-toolbar"><span class="markdown-code-language">bash</span><button type="button" class="markdown-code-copy" aria-label="Copy bash code">Copy</button></div><pre data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">"code inside a list item"</span>
</code></pre><span class="markdown-code-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
</li>
<li>
<p>Item after the code block.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="mixed-nested-list">Mixed nested list<a class="markdown-heading-anchor" href="#mixed-nested-list" aria-label="Link to this section"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span></a></h2>
<ul>
