<div class="markdown-code"><div class="markdown-code-toolbar"><span class="markdown-code-language">bash</span><button type="button" class="markdown-code-copy" aria-label="Copy bash code">Copy</button></div><pre data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="hljs-meta">#!/usr/bin/env bash</span>

