<div class="markdown-code"><div class="markdown-code-toolbar"><span class="markdown-code-language">typescript</span><button type="button" class="markdown-code-copy" aria-label="Copy typescript code">Copy</button></div><pre data-language="typescript"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="hljs-keyword">interface</span> <span class="hljs-title">Article</span> {
