<h2 id="language-alias-and-uppercase-identifier">Language alias and uppercase identifier<a class="markdown-heading-anchor" href="#language-alias-and-uppercase-identifier" aria-label="Link to this section"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span></a></h2>
